  <p id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front">晉故輔國參軍豫州陳郡陽夏縣都鄉吉遷里<persName id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0018" ref="z0u_xut_osd">謝球</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0021" ref="z0u_xut_osd">景璋</persName>年卌一義熙三年三月廿六日亡其年七月廿四日安厝丹楊郡秣陵縣賴鄉石泉里牛頭山祖<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0060" type="unresolved">弈</rs>侍中使持節鎮西將軍豫州刺史夫人陳留<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0078" type="unresolved">阮氏</rs>父<persName id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0081" ref="g74_285_6k5">攸</persName>散騎郎夫人潁川<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0089" type="unresolved">庾</rs>諱<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0091" type="unresolved">女淑</rs>太守夫人琅瑘<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0099" type="unresolved">王氏</rs>叔<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0102" type="unresolved">靖</rs>太常卿夫人潁川<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0110" type="unresolved">庾氏</rs>叔<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0113" type="unresolved">玄</rs><rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0114" type="unresolved">伯淵</rs>將軍會稽內史康樂公夫人譙國<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0129" type="unresolved">桓氏</rs>兄<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0132" type="unresolved">珫</rs>人同郡<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0136" type="unresolved">袁氏</rs>兄<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0139" type="unresolved">璵</rs>夫人河東<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0144" type="unresolved">衛氏</rs>外祖<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0148" type="unresolved">翼</rs>車豫寧伯夫刺史夫人<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0158" type="unresolved">劉氏</rs><persName id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0160" ref="z0u_xut_osd">球</persName>妻琅瑘<persName id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0164" ref="y5z_luq_wyd">王德光</persName>祖<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0168" type="unresolved">羲之</rs>右騎將軍揚車騎義興稽內史父<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0183" type="unresolved">煥之</rs>海塩令<persName id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0188" ref="z0u_xut_osd">球</persName>息女<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0191" type="unresolved">令淑</rs>息男<rs id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:front:m0195" type="unresolved">元</rs>軍將軍會州</p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:side">晉故輔國參軍豫州<persName id="c-epitaph-xieqiu-ntu2010:side:m0008" ref="z0u_xut_osd">謝球</persName>安厝丹楊郡牛頭山</p>
